// Pranata mangsa — the Javanese solar farming calendar (GDD §3, ADR-0007).
//
// `realDays` is the traditional length. `gameDays` compresses the 365-day year
// to a 120-day game year while preserving each mangsa's proportion, so Kasa and
// Kanem stay the long ones and Karo and Dhesta stay the short ones. gameDays
// must sum to exactly 120; `validateCalendarData` (M1-01) asserts it wherever
// the file is loaded, and `bun run check:content` (M2-01) will too.
//
// verified: false — the lengths below are transcribed from secondary sources.
// Kasa, Karo, Katelu, Kapat, Kalima, Kanem, Kapitu, Kawolu, Kasanga and Dhesta
// were each confirmed against a published date range; Kasadasa and Sadha fill
// the remaining gaps and are inferred. A Javanese-calendar reference should
// confirm all twelve before v1. Correcting a number here needs no code change.
//
// No prose here, per .claude/rules/content-i18n.md: ids, numbers and enum tags
// only. Each mangsa's name and its *pertanda* (natural sign) are player-facing
// text and live as `calendar:mangsa.<id>.name` / `.sign` in BOTH locales
// (landed in M1-01). The design intent for each sign is
// recorded in GDD §3.1, which is documentation and may hold prose.
{
  verified: false,
  realYearDays: 365,
  gameYearDays: 120,
  mangsa: [
    // id            realDays  gameDays  musim
    { id: 'kasa',     realDays: 41, gameDays: 13, musim: 'kemarau' },
    { id: 'karo',     realDays: 23, gameDays:  8, musim: 'kemarau' },
    { id: 'katelu',   realDays: 24, gameDays:  8, musim: 'kemarau' },
    { id: 'kapat',    realDays: 25, gameDays:  8, musim: 'pancaroba' },
    { id: 'kalima',   realDays: 27, gameDays:  9, musim: 'hujan' },
    { id: 'kanem',    realDays: 43, gameDays: 14, musim: 'hujan' },
    { id: 'kapitu',   realDays: 43, gameDays: 14, musim: 'hujan' },
    { id: 'kawolu',   realDays: 26, gameDays:  9, musim: 'hujan' },
    { id: 'kasanga',  realDays: 25, gameDays:  8, musim: 'hujan' },
    { id: 'kasadasa', realDays: 24, gameDays:  8, musim: 'pancaroba' },
    { id: 'dhesta',   realDays: 23, gameDays:  8, musim: 'kemarau' },
    { id: 'sadha',    realDays: 41, gameDays: 13, musim: 'kemarau' },
  ],
}
